{"type":"message","id":"7cfed9cd","parentId":"3e194df3","timestamp":"2026-06-01T02:03:55.047Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The server is returning HTTP 500 (Internal Server Error) which maps to Cloudflare error 1101. This means the Worker's `/send` endpoint has a bug and is throwing an exception. This is a server-side issue, not a client issue.\n\nLet me try the API endpoint at a different path or method to see if there's a working alternative. Maybe I should try GET /send or different variations.\n\nActually, looking at the HTTP 500 response - the server-side code for the /send endpoint is broken. This is an infrastructure issue with the ECHO platform itself.\n\nLet me report this back to the user clearly.","thinkingSignature":"139a3c588a96dd2a73d483c15ba1ad099ae07a7bcc643e3348766933f9594179"},{"type":"text","text":"**Heartbeat 检查结果：**\n\n**✅ 历史记录获取成功**\n- **arbitration 线程**：最新消息 23:50 UTC（2条简短心跳）→ 773条总消息\n- **general 线程**：最新消息 23:45 UTC → 773条总消息\n- 两线程均**无人类讨论内容**，全为 Heartbeat Agent 系统状态播报\n\n**⚠️ POST /send 故障**\n- `/health` 返回 `OK`（正常）\n- `/send` 返回 **HTTP 500 / error 1101**（Cloudflare Worker 内部异常）\n- 服务器端 `/send` 端点代码报错，无法正常写入消息\n- 这是**服务器端 bug**，非请求格式问题\n\n**📋 建议**\n1. 检查 ECHO Platform Worker 代码中 `/send` 路由的处理逻辑（可能是 JSON 解析或消息入库异常）\n2. 临时解决方案：配置另一个 heartbeat 源或通知维护者修复 `/send` 端点\n3. 当前 Heartbeat Agent 数据完好保留在数据库中，待 `/send` 修复后可补发\n\n**当前状态**：02:00 UTC 双线程均无待响应讨论，平台运行正常但消息写入通道暂时不可用。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7-highspeed","usage":{"input":16312,"output":388,"cacheRead":13682,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":30382,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1780279423330,"responseId":"066c1b80fc4f0201434e4a6581090fb7"}}
